Axioms:
prop_sprop_trusted_elim : forall P : Prop, StrictlyInhabited P -> P
Axioms:
prop_sprop_trusted_exists_intro :
  forall (A : Type) (P : A -> Prop),
  (exists x : A, P x) -> StrictlyExists A P
Axioms:
eq relies on definitional UIP.
prop_sprop_trusted_eq_intro : forall (A : Type) (x y : A), x = y -> eq x y
